    "C1v2/C4v2": "signal = latest decision of the F leg (F3/V5 5 m LS events | F3-w30/V0 hourly) and of E1/V1a (minute) with decision_time <= minute open; book side = F leg if nonzero else E1; pending none (fill at the decision minute open); snapshot = F-leg event index, aux = E1 event index",
